  "id": "delusional-disorder",
  "term": "delusional disorder",
  "definition": "Delusional disorder is a mental disorder in which a person has one or more persistent beliefs that are false but not obviously impossible, lasting at least a month. These beliefs are not better explained by schizophrenia or a mood disorder, and outside the effects of the delusion, the person’s general psychosocial functioning is not markedly impaired.",
